        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1824_6769.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst
<lb n="2"/>und grueß zuvor, insonders lieber herr
<lb n="3"/>landtvogt, gueter fründt und nachbar
<lb n="4"/>Euwer schriben habendt wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">byz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abendt</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">empfangen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voll</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bringen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear>, und
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mornigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinstag</unclear></date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besichtigung</unclear>,
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wadt</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear> gueter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frueyer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagzeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">scheinen</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eersamer</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiezue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> verordnet, und für unpar-
<lb n="11"/>thyisch erkennt hat, da wir
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachmahlen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolzufriden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> herr
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtvogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> von den üwigen
<lb n="14"/>by sölcher verhörung sein werde. Wann
<lb n="15"/>es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemüeschet</unclear> sein wellen, muessendt wirs
<lb n="16"/>vorschehen laßen, welten wir üch
<lb n="17"/>zue antwort in eil nicht pergen. Datum
<lb n="18"/>den <origDate when="1617-03-31" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">31</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">martij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1617</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="19"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">B</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> r. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="21"/>An <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hern</unclear> <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Appollinario</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iten</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">itziger</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtvogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reintal</unclear></placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1824_6770.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="23"/>[]
</p>
